---
description: React + Mantine component patterns
globs: apps/web/**/*.tsx
alwaysApply: false
---

# Components
- Functional components only. Extract hooks into `app/hooks/` when logic exceeds 20 lines.
- Colocate styles as `Component.module.css` next to `Component.tsx`.
- Prefer Mantine primitives (`Group`, `Stack`, `SimpleGrid`) over raw flex/grid divs.
- Theme via `theme.ts`; no inline hex colors — use Mantine tokens (`var(--mantine-color-*)`).

# State
- Local UI state: `useState`. Cross-tree state: Mantine `context` helpers or `zustand` (only if added intentionally).
- Server state: `@tanstack/react-query` — never store fetched data in Redux/zustand.

# Accessibility
- Charts must have `aria-label` describing the dataset and a hidden `<table>` fallback for screen readers.
- All interactive elements reachable via keyboard; modals trap focus.
